# Git commits — no Co-authored-by trailers

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` lines to commit messages (including `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, Copilot, or any agent).
- Commits should list only the human author; no AI/agent co-author attribution in git history.
- When committing on behalf of the user, use a plain commit message with no co-author trailers.
